Marlin-2B on AnyCloud

This independent, AnyCloud-powered artifact packages the creator's public
caption() and find() helpers as a finite batch Job. It adds input/output,
validation, and reproducibility metadata without changing model weights,
canonical prompts, generation defaults, or upstream parsing.

Model: NemoStation/Marlin-2B
https://huggingface.co/NemoStation/Marlin-2B
